      ":question/problem": "Calculate $F+G,$ where $F=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$ and \n$G=\\begin{bmatrix}-11 & -12 \\\\ -10 & -6\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n| $F+G=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |",
